{"id":"n15078-10-7","stage":2,"title":"들이다 · 感兴趣","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15078-10-7-1","ko":"넌 어쩜 그렇게 운동만 해?","zh":"你怎么总是只顾着运动啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩜","meaning":"怎么","explanation":"어쩜：怎么","readings":[{"term":"어쩜","audio":"/audio/63dbd7e7aeabb3635039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15089","senseId":"2","lemma":"어쩜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩜","audio":"/audio/63dbd7e7aeabb3635039.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"운동만","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동만","audio":"/audio/588e3552490b2fcd977e.mp3"}},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"63dbd7e7aeabb363","term":"어쩜","zh":"怎么","audio":"/audio/63dbd7e7aeabb3635039.mp3","entryId":"15089","definition":"到底为什么。","pronunciation":["어쩜"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d32f2158b969d1f491e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15078-10-7-2","ko":"이게 한번 맛을 들이니까 그만두질 못하겠어.","zh":"运动这事，一尝到乐趣，我就停不下来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一……就……（强调尝到乐趣之后）","explanation":"한번 在这里强调尝到运动乐趣之后就停不下来的状态，与 맛을 들이니까 连用；不是试着做某事的试验义。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"1","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"맛을","meaning":"乐，乐趣，意思","explanation":"맛：乐，乐趣，意思；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"3","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛을","audio":"/audio/7fa088e060c6f40f7de7.mp3"}},{"text":"들이니까","meaning":"感兴趣","explanation":"들이다：感兴趣；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"들이다","audio":"/audio/d301b4f8af6e22a42158.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15078","senseId":"10","lemma":"들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들이니까","audio":"/audio/f3c5a33acfaef9614d85.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두질","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두질","audio":"/audio/82927e06a337d2e209a9.mp3"}},{"text":"못하겠어.","meaning":"不，未能","explanation":"못하다：不，未能；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26841","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못하겠어","audio":"/audio/44db2cfa9676e6adb981.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"强调某种行动或状态","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"强调某种行动或状态","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"乐，乐趣，意思","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"从某事物或某种现象中体会到的趣味或满足感。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"d301b4f8af6e22a4","term":"들이다","zh":"感兴趣","audio":"/audio/d301b4f8af6e22a42158.mp3","entryId":"15078","definition":"产生兴趣或感情。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不，未能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26841","definition":"表示无法到达之前的话所指的状态。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e72ed86807b5206ad3b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.849,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15078","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"10","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4466,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一旦尝到乐趣，就停不下来了。","我把需要的文件带过来了。","你怎么总是只顾着运动啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["运动这事，一尝到乐趣，我就停不下来了。","你怎么总在运动？","我把需要的文件带过来了。"],"answer":0}]}
